# SisterStop Project Rule

The project rules now live in Markdown so every agent reads the same source:

- `AGENTS.md` — product, users, safety principles, approved UI vocabulary
- `CLAUDE.md` — commands, architecture, delivery rules, repo gotchas
- `docs/SAFETY_POLICY.md` — safety and privacy policy

Read `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` before any significant change.
